  "system": {
    "description": {
      "gm": "",
      "value": "<p><em>Category: Seen Gods</em></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\"><em style=\"mso-bidi-font-style:normal\">Primarily Practiced in: Zahnheim, North Rodda</em></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\"><em style=\"mso-bidi-font-style:normal\">Espirian Domains: The Heavens (Valtal, Elysium)</em></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight:bold\">The Feral represents the untamed nature of the wilds. Her seat represents the push and pull of the hunt, of man and beast that compete against each other, both within themselves and the world against each other. As Allonse takes the title, her followers who chase glory pray to her for strength as they face ever greater challenges, while those who wish to hunt and nourish their families pray for a swift, merciful kill so that they safely return to feed their families. Allonse appears as a hooded loupain with deep red eyes wielding two sickles.</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight:bold\"><strong>Title</strong> The Feral</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight:normal\">Edicts</strong> Hunt more powerful creatures, ensure their remains are put to use, embrace the fight or flight</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight:normal\">Anathema</strong> Allow yourself to be lost in frenzy to the harm of others, hunt for sport and no other purpose</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\"><strong>Areas of Concern</strong></span><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\"> Hunting, Glory, Animals</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\"><strong>Religious Symbol</strong></span><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\"> A clawed tiger paw clutching a sickle</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\"><strong>Sacred Animal</strong></span><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\"> Panther</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:'Calibri',sans-serif;mso-ascii-theme-font:minor-latin;mso-fareast-font-family:Calibri;mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-latin;mso-hansi-theme-font:minor-latin;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin;mso-ansi-language:EN-US;mso-fareast-language:EN-US;mso-bidi-language:AR-SA\"><strong>Sacred Colors</strong> red and dark brown</span></p>"
    },
